Third-party fixtures under this directory (response/, request/, markets/)
are copied verbatim from the ccxt/ccxt repository:

    https://github.com/ccxt/ccxt
    Path: ts/src/test/static/{response,request,markets}/{alpaca,binance}.json

These are ccxt's own recorded real exchange HTTP responses/requests used by
ccxt's static test suite (real Alpaca/Binance API payloads, not hand-written
mocks). Downloaded 2026-07-29 from the `master` branch via
raw.githubusercontent.com for use as REAL-DATA fixtures in this repo's own
test suite (src/executor/*.ccxt-real.test.ts) — never executed against a
live exchange, read-only inputs to our own parsing code.

